# rootless deb 的 DEBIAN/control 示例
# 用 Theos 的话，在 Makefile 里写 THEOS_PACKAGE_SCHEME = rootless，
# 打出来的包会自动是 iphoneos-arm64，文件也会安装到 /var/jb 下，不用手写这个文件。

Package: win.yuhh.yourtweak
Name: Your Tweak
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: 一句话介绍
Maintainer: Your Name <you@example.com>
Author: Your Name <you@example.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), mobilesubstrate
SileoDepiction: https://repo.yuhh.win/depictions/native/win.yuhh.yourtweak.json
Icon: https://repo.yuhh.win/assets/icons/win.yuhh.yourtweak.png
